{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-014-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/StrategyConversionCaptureTests.cs","line":928,"method":"TheDoorWritesItsRowsBeforeItDecidesHowToDispatchTheRecalc","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs:3890; delete or move the door's Ledger.AddAction(action) call past the DecideRecalcDispatch call at :3915 -> this cell stays green, because the first IndexOf match is the unrelated OnKscSpending call at :3781","what_it_asserts":"The first 'Ledger.AddAction(action);' in LedgerOrchestrator.cs precedes the first 'StrategyConversionCapture.DecideRecalcDispatch(' call, and the file mentions WarpToTimeConsumer.RunNextFrame(.","why_weak":"LedgerOrchestrator.cs has two Ledger.AddAction(action); sites; the first (:3781) is in OnKscSpending, not OnStrategyCurrencyConversion. The ordering comparison is satisfied by that unrelated earlier call, so the exact refactor the comment names - moving the door's row write behind the deferred recalc - leaves the cell green. The RunNextFrame Contains assertion adds no ordering either.","proposed_action":"Scope both scans to the OnStrategyCurrencyConversion body: start them at src.IndexOf(\"internal static void OnStrategyCurrencyConversion\", StringComparison.Ordinal), so the door's own write is the one ordered against its own dispatch decision.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"ScienceModule","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/GameActions/ScienceModule.cs","sut_line":416,"case_kind":"state-transition","proposed_name":"ScienceModule_StrategyCredit_AlsoFeedsEffectiveEarnings","sketch":"var module = new ScienceModule(); module.Reset(); module.ProcessStrategyScienceCredit(new GameAction { UT = 1.0, Type = GameActionType.StrategyScienceCredit, ScienceAwarded = 12.0f }); Assert.Equal(12.0, module.GetTotalEffectiveEarnings(), 4);","guards":"The totalEffectiveEarnings += credit line at ScienceModule.cs:416: dropping it under-reports spendable science through GetAvailableScience, and no existing cell calls ProcessStrategyScienceCredit with a positive credit and reads the earnings total (StrategyConversionCaptureTests.cs:789 asserts only GetRunningScience).","risk":"career"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"StrategyConversionCapture","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/GameActions/StrategyConversionCapture.cs","sut_line":314,"case_kind":"boundary","proposed_name":"EvaluateLegs_AtExactlyMinCaptureMagnitude_IsCaptured","sketch":"var sci = StrategyConversionCapture.EvaluateLegs(Query(dS: 0.001)); Assert.Single(sci); var funds = StrategyConversionCapture.EvaluateLegs(Query(dF: 0.001)); Assert.Single(funds); var rep = StrategyConversionCapture.EvaluateLegs(Query(dR: -0.001)); Assert.Single(rep);","guards":"The inclusive >= comparisons at StrategyConversionCapture.cs:314 (science), :325 (funds) and :334 (reputation): flipping any to > would silently drop a movement exactly at the floor, and SubThresholdMovements_AreNotCaptured only probes values orders of magnitude below it.","risk":"career"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"LedgerOrchestrator","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs","sut_line":4017,"case_kind":"negative","proposed_name":"BuildStrategyConversionAction_ZeroFundsDelta_ReturnsNullAndWarns","sketch":"var action = LedgerOrchestrator.BuildStrategyConversionAction(123.0, new StrategyConversionLeg { Currency = StrategyConversionCurrency.Funds, Delta = 0.0 }, \"ScienceTransmission\"); Assert.Null(action); Assert.Contains(logLines, l => l.Contains(\"zero funds delta\"));","guards":"The leg.Delta == 0.0 null arm at LedgerOrchestrator.cs:4017 (Warn + null): it is the only BuildStrategyConversionAction branch with no cell, and it is what keeps a zero-magnitude funds leg (if EvaluateLegs' MinCaptureMagnitude floor ever changed) from becoming a no-op FundsSpending row.","risk":"career"}
